fixture dash_jump_early_press_waits_for_frame_5
doc BUILD.md s5 Dash-jump window "frames 5 to 9" and Jump buffer "8 f" (ADR-0010, Dash-jump, early press): a tap on dash frame 3 (tick 2), let go at once, is not eaten and does not fire early; it waits in the buffer and the dash-jump fires on dash frame 5 (tick 4), 2 frames after the press, keeping the full 20 u/f.
room test/flat
frames 30
input
  0 R dash
  1 R
  2 R jump
  3..9 R
end
expect
  at 3 state=dash dash_frame=4 event.jump=0
  at 4 event.jump=1 vx=5120 state=air
  never 0..3 event.jump=1
end
